menu "HomeControl network"

	config HC_WPS_BUTTON_GPIO
		int "GPIO of the WPS button (active low; -1: no button)"
		range -1 48
		default 9 if IDF_TARGET_ESP32C6
		default 0 if IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3
		default -1
		help
			Holding this button for about 3 s starts WPS push-button provisioning. The default is
			the BOOT button of the Espressif devkits (GPIO9 on the ESP32-C6, GPIO0 on the
			ESP32-S3), a strapping pin that is read only after boot. The pin is configured as an
			input with the internal pull-up; pressed means low.

endmenu
